{"id":"torrey:punishments","source":"torrey","name":"Punishments","slug":"punishments","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Antiquity of — Ge 4:13,14.","refs":[["Gen",4,13,4,13],["Gen",4,14,4,14]]},{"text":"Power of inflicting, given to magistrates — Job 31:11; Ro 13:4.","refs":[["Job",31,11,31,11],["Rom",13,4,13,4]]},{"text":"Designed to be a warning to others — De 13:11; 17:13; 19:20.","refs":[["Deut",13,11,13,11],["Deut",17,13,17,13],["Deut",19,20,19,20]]},{"text":"On the guilty. — De 24:16; Pr 17:26.","refs":[["Deut",24,16,24,16],["Prov",17,26,17,26]]},{"text":"Without pity. — De 19:13,21.","refs":[["Deut",19,13,19,13],["Deut",19,21,19,21]]},{"text":"Without partiality. — De 13:6-8.","refs":[["Deut",13,6,13,8]]},{"text":"By order of magistrates. — Ac 16:22.","refs":[["Acts",16,22,16,22]]},{"text":"By order of kings. — 2Sa 1:13-16; 1Ki 2:23-46.","refs":[["2Sam",1,13,1,16],["1Kgs",2,23,2,46]]},{"text":"Immediately after sentence was passed. — De 25:2; Jos 7:25.","refs":[["Deut",25,2,25,2],["Josh",7,25,7,25]]},{"text":"By the witnesses. — De 13:9; 17:7; Joh 8:7; Ac 7:58,59.","refs":[["Deut",13,9,13,9],["Deut",17,7,17,7],["John",8,7,8,7],["Acts",7,58,7,58],["Acts",7,59,7,59]]},{"text":"By the people. — Nu 15:35,36; De 13:9.","refs":[["Num",15,35,15,35],["Num",15,36,15,36],["Deut",13,9,13,9]]},{"text":"By soldiers. — 2Sa 1:15; Mt 27:27-35.","refs":[["2Sam",1,15,1,15],["Matt",27,27,27,35]]},{"text":"Sometimes deferred until God was consulted — Nu 15:34.","refs":[["Num",15,34,15,34]]},{"text":"Sometimes deferred for a considerable time — 1Ki 2:5,6,8,9.","refs":[["1Kgs",2,5,2,5],["1Kgs",2,6,2,6],["1Kgs",2,8,2,8],["1Kgs",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Imprisonment. — Ezr 7:26; Mt 5:25.","refs":[["Ezra",7,26,7,26],["Matt",5,25,5,25]]},{"text":"Confinement in a dungeon. — Jer 38:6; Zec 9:11.","refs":[["Jer",38,6,38,6],["Zech",9,11,9,11]]},{"text":"Confinement in stocks. — Jer 20:2; Ac 16:24.","refs":[["Jer",20,2,20,2],["Acts",16,24,16,24]]},{"text":"Fine, or giving of money. — Ex 21:22; De 22:19.","refs":[["Exod",21,22,21,22],["Deut",22,19,22,19]]},{"text":"Restitution. — Ex 21:36; 22:1-4; Le 6:4,5; 24:18.","refs":[["Exod",21,36,21,36],["Exod",22,1,22,4],["Lev",6,4,6,4],["Lev",6,5,6,5],["Lev",24,18,24,18]]},{"text":"Retaliation or injuring according to the injury done. — Ex 21:24; De 19:21.","refs":[["Exod",21,24,21,24],["Deut",19,21,19,21]]},{"text":"Binding with chains and fetters. — Ps 105:18.","refs":[["Ps",105,18,105,18]]},{"text":"Scourging. — De 25:2,3; Mt 27:26; Ac 22:25; 2Co 11:24.","refs":[["Deut",25,2,25,2],["Deut",25,3,25,3],["Matt",27,26,27,26],["Acts",22,25,22,25],["2Cor",11,24,11,24]]},{"text":"Selling the criminal. — Mt 18:25.","refs":[["Matt",18,25,18,25]]},{"text":"Banishment. — Ezr 7:26; Re 1:9.","refs":[["Ezra",7,26,7,26],["Rev",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Torturing. — Mt 18:34; Heb 11:37.","refs":[["Matt",18,34,18,34],["Heb",11,37,11,37]]},{"text":"Putting out the eyes. — Jdj 16:21; 1Sa 11:2.","refs":[["Judg",16,21,16,21],["1Sam",11,2,11,2]]},{"text":"Cutting off hands and feet. — 2Sa 4:12.","refs":[["2Sam",4,12,4,12]]},{"text":"Mutilating the hands and feet. — Jdj 1:5-7.","refs":[["Judg",1,5,1,7]]},{"text":"Cutting off nose and ears. — Eze 23:25.","refs":[["Ezek",23,25,23,25]]},{"text":"Plucking out the hair. — Ne 13:25; Isa 50:6.","refs":[["Neh",13,25,13,25],["Isa",50,6,50,6]]},{"text":"Confiscating the property. — Ezr 7:26.","refs":[["Ezra",7,26,7,26]]},{"text":"Inflicting of capital, not permitted to the Jews by the Romans — Joh 18:31.","refs":[["John",18,31,18,31]]},{"text":"Burning. — Ge 38:24; Le 20:14; Da 3:6.","refs":[["Gen",38,24,38,24],["Lev",20,14,20,14],["Dan",3,6,3,6]]},{"text":"Hanging. — Nu 25:4; De 21:22,23; Jos 8:29; 2Sa 21:12; Es 7:9,10.","refs":[["Num",25,4,25,4],["Deut",21,22,21,22],["Deut",21,23,21,23],["Josh",8,29,8,29],["2Sam",21,12,21,12],["Esth",7,9,7,9],["Esth",7,10,7,10]]},{"text":"Crucifying. — Mt 20:19; 27:35.","refs":[["Matt",20,19,20,19],["Matt",27,35,27,35]]},{"text":"Beheading. — Ge 40:19; Mr 6:16,27.","refs":[["Gen",40,19,40,19],["Mark",6,16,6,16],["Mark",6,27,6,27]]},{"text":"Slaying with the sword. — 1Sa 15:33; Ac 12:2.","refs":[["1Sam",15,33,15,33],["Acts",12,2,12,2]]},{"text":"Stoning. — Le 24:14; De 13:10; Ac 7:59.","refs":[["Lev",24,14,24,14],["Deut",13,10,13,10],["Acts",7,59,7,59]]},{"text":"Cutting in pieces. — Da 2:5; Mt 24:51.","refs":[["Dan",2,5,2,5],["Matt",24,51,24,51]]},{"text":"Sawing asunder. — Heb 11:37.","refs":[["Heb",11,37,11,37]]},{"text":"Exposing to wild beasts. — Da 6:16,24; 1Co 15:32.","refs":[["Dan",6,16,6,16],["Dan",6,24,6,24],["1Cor",15,32,15,32]]},{"text":"Bruising in mortars. — Pr 27:22.","refs":[["Prov",27,22,27,22]]},{"text":"Casting headlong from a rock. — 2Ch 25:12.","refs":[["2Chr",25,12,25,12]]},{"text":"Casting into the sea. — Mt 18:6.","refs":[["Matt",18,6,18,6]]},{"text":"Strangers not exempted from — Le 20:2.","refs":[["Lev",20,2,20,2]]},{"text":"Were sometimes commuted — Ex 21:29,30.","refs":[["Exod",21,29,21,29],["Exod",21,30,21,30]]},{"text":"For murder not to be commuted — Nu 35:31,32.","refs":[["Num",35,31,35,31],["Num",35,32,35,32]]}],"refCount":101}
